From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: mediatek: reject encrypted NPU flow without crypto provider

The inline EIP197 provider is optional. Match the plain IPsec flow action's
guard before calling its CDRT callback for an encrypted NPU tunnel.

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/mediatek/mtk_ppe_offload.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/mediatek/mtk_ppe_offload.c
@@ -665,6 +665,9 @@
 				struct xfrm_state *xs_old = dst_xfrm(act->npu.dst);
 				struct xfrm_state *xs;
 
+				if (!mtk_flow_offload_get_cdrt)
+					return -EOPNOTSUPP;
+
 				if (!xs_old)
 					return -EOPNOTSUPP;
 				/*
